---

<Layout
  title="快眠ラボ"
  description="マットレス・枕・布団などの寝具を徹底比較。腰痛・肩こり・不眠など睡眠の悩みを解決する一台が見つかります。"
>
  <Header />
  <main>

    <!-- ===== HERO ===== -->
    <section class="hero-img-section">
      <a href="#top3">
        <picture>
          <source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="/hero-sp.png" />
          <img
            src="/hero-pc.png"
            alt="人気マットレスを徹底比較！あなたにぴったりのマットレスが見つかる"
            class="hero-img"
            loading="eager"
            fetchpriority="high"
          />
        </picture>
      </a>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== TOP3 ===== -->
    <section class="section" id="top3">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">迷ったらこれ！編集部おすすめマットレスTOP3</h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">「どれがいいか分からない」という方へ。編集部が自信を持っておすすめできる3台を厳選しました。</p>
        <div class="top3-list">
          {products.slice(0, 3).map(p => (
            <div class="top3-card">
              <div class="top3-rank">
                <span class={`rank-circle rank-circle-${p.rank}`}>{p.rank}</span>
                <span class="top3-rank-label">第{p.rank}位</span>
                <span class="top3-rank-name-sp">{p.name}</span>
              </div>
              <div class="top3-img-wrap">
                <img src={p.image} alt={p.name} class="top3-img" loading="lazy" />
              </div>
              <div class="top3-body">
                <h3 class="top3-name">{p.name}</h3>
                <div class="top3-score">
                  <span class="score-num">{p.score}</span>
                  <span class="score-max">/ 35点</span>
                  <span class="score-stars">{'★'.repeat(Math.round(p.score / 7))}{'☆'.repeat(5 - Math.round(p.score / 7))}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="top3-tags">
                  {p.tags.map(t => <span class="tag">{t}</span>)}
                </div>
                <p class="top3-recommend"><span class="recommend-icon">こんな人に</span>{p.recommend}</p>
                <div class="top3-meta">
                  <span class="meta-item"><span class="meta-label">価格（S）</span><span class="meta-val">{p.priceS}</span></span>
                  <span class="meta-item"><span class="meta-label">お試し</span><span class="meta-val">{p.trial}</span></span>
                  <span class="meta-item"><span class="meta-label">保証</span><span class="meta-val">{p.warranty}</span></span>
                </div>
                <div class="cta-btn-wrap" style="margin-top: 0.75rem;">
                  <a href={p.affiliateHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="cta-btn">
                    公式サイトで最安値を確認する →
                  </a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== 選び方ガイド ===== -->
    <section class="section section-bg">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">失敗しないマットレスの選び方</h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 1.75rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 0.92rem;">購入前に確認すべき5つのポイントです。</p>
        <div class="guide-grid">

          <!-- 01 硬め・やわらかめ -->
          <div class="guide-card">
            <div class="guide-icon-wrap">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 56 56" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="guide-svg">
                <!-- Left: firm (flat layers) -->
                <rect x="4" y="36" width="20" height="5" rx="2" fill="#1B3A5C"/>
                <rect x="4" y="29" width="20" height="5" rx="2" fill="#1B3A5C" opacity="0.5"/>
                <circle cx="14" cy="20" r="4" fill="#1B3A5C" opacity="0.4"/>
                <line x1="14" y1="24" x2="14" y2="29" stroke="#1B3A5C" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.4"/>
                <!-- Right: soft (wavy layers) -->
                <path d="M32 41 Q36 37 40 41 Q44 45 48 41" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="3" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <path d="M32 34 Q36 30 40 34 Q44 38 48 34" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="3" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.5"/>
                <circle cx="40" cy="21" r="4" fill="#C9A84C" opacity="0.7"/>
                <path d="M40 25 Q38 29 40 32" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.7"/>
                <!-- Divider -->
                <line x1="28" y1="16" x2="28" y2="46" stroke="#e2e8f0" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="3,3"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="guide-num-badge">01</span>
            <p class="guide-card-title">体重×寝姿勢で硬さを選ぶ</p>
            <p class="guide-card-body">体重が重い方や仰向け寝はお尻が沈みすぎない「<strong>硬め</strong>」、小柄な方や横向き寝は肩や腰を圧迫しない「<strong>やわらかめ</strong>」が基本。硬さを間違えると腰痛や肩こりの原因になります。</p>
          </div>

          <!-- 02 ゾーン設計 -->
          <div class="guide-card">
            <div class="guide-icon-wrap">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 56 56" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="guide-svg">
                <!-- Body lying sideways -->
                <ellipse cx="28" cy="34" rx="22" ry="8" fill="#EBF2FA"/>
                <!-- Head -->
                <circle cx="46" cy="27" r="6" fill="#1B3A5C" opacity="0.25"/>
                <!-- Shoulder zone highlight -->
                <ellipse cx="34" cy="27" rx="8" ry="7" fill="#C9A84C" opacity="0.75"/>
                <circle cx="34" cy="27" r="3" fill="#fff" opacity="0.6"/>
                <!-- Body -->
                <ellipse cx="16" cy="32" rx="11" ry="6" fill="#1B3A5C" opacity="0.12"/>
                <!-- Arrow down to shoulder -->
                <line x1="34" y1="12" x2="34" y2="18" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <path d="M30 17 L34 21 L38 17" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="guide-num-badge">02</span>
            <p class="guide-card-title">部位別のゾーニング構造かどうか</p>
            <p class="guide-card-body">重い「腰」は硬く支え、出っ張る「肩」は柔らかく沈めるのが理想。部位ごとに硬さが変わる「<strong>ゾーン設計</strong>」を選べば、腰痛と肩こりの両方をケアできます。</p>
          </div>

          <!-- 03 寝返り -->
          <div class="guide-card">
            <div class="guide-icon-wrap">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 56 56" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="guide-svg">
                <!-- Rotation arc (solid) -->
                <path d="M28 10 A18 18 0 1 1 11 22" stroke="#1B3A5C" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/>
                <!-- Rotation arc (dashed) -->
                <path d="M28 10 A18 18 0 0 0 11 22" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none" stroke-dasharray="4,3"/>
                <!-- Arrow heads -->
                <path d="M23 7 L28 11 L33 7" stroke="#1B3A5C" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none"/>
                <path d="M8 27 L11 22 L16 25" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none"/>
                <!-- Person in center -->
                <circle cx="28" cy="30" r="4" fill="#1B3A5C" opacity="0.15"/>
                <circle cx="28" cy="24" r="3.5" fill="#1B3A5C" opacity="0.2"/>
                <line x1="28" y1="27.5" x2="28" y2="34" stroke="#1B3A5C" stroke-width="2" opacity="0.2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="guide-num-badge">03</span>
            <p class="guide-card-title">寝返りのしやすさ</p>
            <p class="guide-card-body">マットレスが柔らかすぎると寝返りに体力を使い、朝の疲労感に繋がります。トランポリンのように体を押し返す「<strong>高反発</strong>」素材なら、自然な寝返りができ朝スッキリ起きられます。</p>
          </div>

          <!-- 04 厚み -->
          <div class="guide-card">
            <div class="guide-icon-wrap">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 56 56" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="guide-svg">
                <!-- Layers -->
                <rect x="8" y="13" width="36" height="6" rx="2" fill="#C9A84C" opacity="0.85"/>
                <rect x="8" y="21" width="36" height="8" rx="2" fill="#1B3A5C" opacity="0.45"/>
                <rect x="8" y="31" width="36" height="8" rx="2" fill="#1B3A5C" opacity="0.7"/>
                <rect x="8" y="41" width="36" height="3" rx="1" fill="#1B3A5C" opacity="0.25"/>
                <!-- Measurement arrow -->
                <line x1="50" y1="13" x2="50" y2="44" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="2"/>
                <path d="M47 15 L50 12 L53 15" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none"/>
                <path d="M47 42 L50 45 L53 42" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="guide-num-badge">04</span>
            <p class="guide-card-title">厚み20cm以上か</p>
            <p class="guide-card-body">薄いマットレスは腰が床にぶつかる「底付き感」が出やすく、へたりも早いです。ベッド用なら厚み<strong>20cm以上</strong>（床置きなら10cm以上）を選ぶと耐久性も高く安心です。</p>
          </div>

          <!-- 05 トライアル+保証 -->
          <div class="guide-card">
            <div class="guide-icon-wrap">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 56 56" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="guide-svg">
                <!-- Calendar -->
                <rect x="4" y="14" width="24" height="22" rx="3" fill="#EBF2FA" stroke="#1B3A5C" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                <rect x="4" y="14" width="24" height="7" rx="3" fill="#1B3A5C"/>
                <rect x="13" y="10" width="2.5" height="7" rx="1.25" fill="#1B3A5C"/>
                <rect x="20" y="10" width="2.5" height="7" rx="1.25" fill="#1B3A5C"/>
